# IEEE 13 OCHRE transformer codes (OpenDSS XfmrCode -> TransformerTankConfiguration)
#
# Six single-phase 3-winding center-tap codes (xfcode_AS/BS/CS_config and
# xfcode_AS/BS/CS_config_634) and one 3-phase code (xfcode_OBJECT_151, at the end), one
# tank configuration each, 1:1 with the deck. Tank-only templates: lugs, windings,
# impedances; the phases are on each instance's TransformerPhaseEnds.
#   _config:     primary wdg1 kv=2.401 (across the winding, 4.16 kV LL system)
#   _config_634: primary wdg1 kv=0.277 (across the winding, 480 V LL system)
# The phase letter in the name is the primary phase the deck uses each code on (AS = A,
# BS = B, CS = C); the tanks themselves are identical. As tank-only templates they carry
# no phase: each instance's TransformerPhaseEnds do (transformers.cimtbl).
#
# Follows distribution/templates/padmount_1ph_250kva.cimtbl:
#   ratedU = phase-to-phase nameplate designation: 4.160 kV (4.16 kV system) for
#            _config, 0.480 kV (480 V system) for _config_634; halves 0.240 kV (240 V)
#   baseU  = coil voltage across the winding (OpenDSS kvs): 2.401 / 0.277 primary, 0.120 halves
#   ratedS = the winding's own rating: primary 75 kVA; each half 37.5 kVA (half the tank)
#   baseS  = tank kVA (OpenDSS kvas, 75): the base for both halves and for the percent values
#
# Per code (all six):
#   xhl=1.632 xht=1.632 xlt=1.088  -> TransformerMeshImpedance x (percent): 12, 13, 23
#   wdg1 %R=0.300; wdg2 %R=0.600; wdg3 %R=0.600 -> TransformerWinding r (percent)
#   OpenDSS kva=75 on every winding is the tank rating; halves are 37.5 each.
#
# OpenDSS percent noloadloss/imag and percentImpedance are not in the deck, so omitted.
# Lugs (designations as a standard 1-phase center-tap tank; the deck names buses, not
# bushings): sequenceNumber = the conductor, in terminal order: 1 = H1 (end 1);
# 2 = X1 (s1), 3 = X3 (s2), 4 = N (end 2). H2 shares 4: the deck's primary returns to
# node 0, the center tap's ground (buses=[node.1 trip_node.1.0 trip_node.0.2]).
# Polarity: wdg1 H1 -> H2, wdg2 X1 -> X2 (s1 -> N), wdg3 X2 -> X3 (N -> s2).

Profile = cim18v17

Table TransformerTankConfiguration: mRID, name
    xc_xfcode_as_config,      xfcode_AS_config
    xc_xfcode_bs_config,      xfcode_BS_config
    xc_xfcode_cs_config,      xfcode_CS_config
    xc_xfcode_as_config_634,  xfcode_AS_config_634
    xc_xfcode_bs_config_634,  xfcode_BS_config_634
    xc_xfcode_cs_config_634,  xfcode_CS_config_634

