# --- xfcode_OBJECT_151: 3-phase 500 kVA, 4.16 kV - 0.48 kV wye-wye (YNyn0), used once
# (transformer_633-634). Deck: %loadloss=1.100 xhl=2.0, wdg=1 conn=wye kva=500 kv=4.160,
# wdg=2 conn=wye kva=500 kv=0.480.
# One coil per phase per side, H1-H0 / X1-X0 on leg a, and so on (wye-wye, 0 degrees).
#   ratedU = the side's kV (4.160, 0.480); baseU = the coil, line to neutral
#            (4.160 / sqrt(3) = 2.40178, 0.480 / sqrt(3) = 0.27713)
#   ratedS = 500 (three-phase basis); baseS = 500 / 3 = 166.6667 per coil
#   r = %loadloss / 2 = 0.55 % per coil; xhl = 2.0 % on each leg's mesh. On the coil
#   base these are the deck's three-phase percent values unchanged.
# Lugs: sequenceNumber in terminal order: end 1 H1 H2 H3 H0 = 1-4, end 2 X1 X2 X3 X0 = 5-8.
Object TransformerTankConfiguration: mRID=xc_xfcode_object_151, name=xfcode_OBJECT_151

Table TransformerLug: mRID, designation, sequenceNumber, TankConfiguration=xc_xfcode_object_151
